er than another move.', "When When combining proposals where some are 'think' statements and others are concrete actions.: When combining proposals, always override any 'think' or meta-commentary statements with the concrete executable action command that advances the goal, since only executable actions change the environment.", "When Combining proposals where one is a non-executable 'think' statement and the intended next action is inferable from context.: Override 'think' proposals and output the concrete executable action (e.g., the navigation or manipulation command) that advances the goal."]}
